l,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ako is an honor student and an earnest girl. She is not good at sports."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her breasts stand out from those of her peers, stimulating baser instincts in people around her, and she is bothered by the gazes she receives."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a good personality and is loved by everyone. She is not very assertive and can be submissive. She is bashful and sometimes has difficulty expressing her feelings to others, giving her a feeling of inferiority towards Mio, who isn't afraid to speak her mind. However, she takes her position as the older sister seriously, and believes that she needs to be the responsible one."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c62f8b84463d4ed39eed21f41b3e24792a8057547653898832a1edb0961a5a07.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a00e540b6ee34bf3a2e8b6e31ebbaac57155735622b4a03aa08ed355191a70a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花寺 香蓮","creatorId":"vndb:s4474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4474","name":"平野 有紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76610","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67987","characterName":"美袋 深青","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67987"},"originalCharacterName":"美袋 深青","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mio has been a hikikomori since the latter half of middle school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobby is playing the role of guild princess in MMOs and other online games, manipulating the old guys there and causing them to go to ruin. Out of a weakness in her heart, she maintains self-esteem by gathering followers through live-streaming on the internet. These actions are driven by her inferiority complex and hatred towards her older sister, who seems to do everything with ease, combined with the tumult of emotions that comes with puberty. She doesn't really understand it herself, however."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems dominant, but also has a submissive side. She craves to be scolded."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/19af1bd200d74d34e0c3719d59b7e2395dc574d5c43ee0b45b9ea0a7b1d14a23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb7b50592a3111280c178e6bae6fef1181255678b8aa395214bd2cdb0df08cce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花寺 香蓮","creatorId":"vndb:s4474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4474","name":"平野 有紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76611","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c68228","characterName":"美袋 詩杏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c68228"},"originalCharacterName":"美袋 詩杏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.d